SUMMARY:Tour de Streets
LOCATION:Livable Streets Alliance\, 100 Sidney St\, Cambridge\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Tour de Streets!\nTour de Streets is an annual fund
 raising event\, featuring a walk\, bike ride\, and a celebration with free
  food\, drinks\, + activities provided by local vendors!\n\nTo ride with B
 oston Cafe Bikers you must be registered (it’s free!) so use the link ab
 ove to sign up\n\nThe bike ride is 2 hours long\, ~12 miles starting at 10
 :15: A leisurely ride for people of all abilities. Includes riding along t
 he Charles River and on new bicycle infrastructure around Boston\, Cambrid
 ge \,and Somerville.\n\nDate: Saturday October 24  10:30 AM - 2:30 PM\nLoc
 ation: LivableStreets Office\, 100 Sidney Street\, Cambridge 02139 (near C
 entral Square).\n\nThis is a great opportunity to connect with partners an
 d friends as we celebrate LivableStreets’ accomplishments and ensure we 
 have the resources to fund our work in the coming years.\n\nRSVP: https://
 partiful.com/e/kJ7dHkHGj3ZXSU8IfUHD
URL:https://partiful.com/e/kJ7dHkHGj3ZXSU8IfUHD
END:VEVENT
